       "text": "I haven't entered this order, because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Dose per administration:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of ibuprofen, which is 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6400 mg/day. The maximum for adults is 3200 mg/day under prescription, and 1200 mg/day for over-the-counter use.\n- **Risks at this dose:** It substantially raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth four times daily** (3200 mg/day), the usual maximum for anti-inflammatory dosing.\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth three or four times daily**, for general pain.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into doses such as 400 mg four times daily or 800 mg twice daily.\n\nTell me which dose you want, or confirm that 1600 mg four times daily is intended and why. I'll enter the order once that's settled."
